# Archive

::summary
The Archive surface (Settings → Archive, RULED 08-05) in the shell wrapper: circled icon-only back to Settings, the hidden-not-deleted note, and archived-item rows — kind icon, title, kind + archived date meta, trailing Unarchive action.
::

::app-shell[name=archive layout=sidebar-main-panel height=720]

:::sidebar[position=left width=240]

::::toolbar
- text[value="Surfspace" size=22]
::::

